# unused -- when a broadcast network has more than one matching channel
# (e.g. a Green Bay CBS affiliate AND a Pittsburgh one both carry the same
# national CBS broadcast), resolve_channel_id picked whichever came first in
# an arbitrary dict order, with zero team-based preference. This doesn't
# apply to every game -- the specific game reported only had one broadcast
# option (national NFL Network, no local alternative) so it wasn't actually
# affected -- but the underlying gap is real for any regular-season game
# with a genuine market choice.
